            "body": "Verified on GB10 (sm_121, 101376 B, triton 3.7.1) with the reproducer from #60172: `Required: 102400` before, passes after (max abs err 3.4e-3 vs torch reference). One refinement: only the fp8-KV MLA tile (`BLOCK_DMODEL=512 + BLOCK_DPE=64`) overflows at two stages (102400 B); bf16 KV needs 63488 and is ~4% faster at two stages (1.090 vs 1.138 ms, B=32 H=32 seq=4096). Adding `k_buffer.element_size() == 1 and BLOCK_DMODEL + BLOCK_DPE > 512` to the `< 128 KiB` gate keeps bf16-KV MLA decode at two stages. LGTM either way.",
